1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Book "Zhangjiajie" wrong and you'll miss the Avatar pillars. I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,800
Because "Zhangjiajie" is really two different parks.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,200
The Avatar sandstone pillars sit in the Forest Park, out in Wulingyuan.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,600
Tianmen Mountain — the glass walk and cable car — is a separate place.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,800
They're about 30 km apart, on different tickets.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,600
Double-tap if you'd want to see both.

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,600
★ Expert Tip: For the Avatar peaks, book the Forest Park at Wulingyuan — not Tianmen.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,200
So which one did you think "Zhangjiajie" was? Tell me below.
